{
 "model": "unified v8: backbone unified_back8.onnx = MobileNetV3-Small (v6 trunk, further fine-tuned end-to-end [features[10],[11]] on 150-364 minus val/test/HOLD: + the 251-364 live rounds incl. offense and the 2.3 patch), 192-d per frame; head unified_head8.onnx = 2-layer causal GRU (hidden 128) over 30 steps of [feat 192 | aux 15] (inputs unchanged from v6). Output 133 = the v6 77 (same offsets/labels, combo = v6 gap bins) + fut1f 46 (1..45 f + none, 1-frame next-contact distribution) + ours 6 + cont 2 + land 2. IMPORTANT: head8 requires back8; switch both together (comboV6:true). ",
